-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Required at runtime — NOT redistributed
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

QuestCodex compiles against the SPT server assemblies (SPTushonka.Common,
SPTushonka.DI, SPTushonka.Server.Core, SPTushonka.Server.Web) and runs inside
the SPT server process. None of those assemblies are included in the QuestCodex
distribution -- the packaging script fails the build if any DLL other than
QuestCodex.dll reaches the output. Users obtain SPT separately, under its own
terms.

Escape from Tarkov and SPT are the property of their respective owners.
QuestCodex is an unofficial, unaffiliated third-party mod.
